DESCRIPTIONS = {'island(s)': 'Sea-separated capturable properties with usable transport access, using convoluted transport v2.', 'pipe seams': 'At least one intact breakable pipe seam (terrain ID 113 or 114).', 'predeployed transports': 'Usable predeployed T-Copter, Lander or Black Boat; naval transports require an adjacent Sea or Beach tile.', 'immobile pre-deploy': 'At least one predeployed unit without a legal adjacent terrain destination for its movement class.', 'Flip symmetry': 'Gameplay tile types have horizontal and/or vertical reflection symmetry, ignoring sprite orientation, property owners and units.', 'diagonal symmetry': 'Square map gameplay tile types have reflection symmetry across at least one diagonal, ignoring sprite orientation, property owners and units.', 'rotational symmetry': 'Gameplay tile types have 180-degree or square-map 90/270-degree symmetry, ignoring sprite orientation, property owners and units.', 'Asymmetrical': 'Gameplay tile types have none of the supported non-identity reflection or rotation symmetries, ignoring sprite orientation, property owners and units.', '1vX team play': 'Heuristic: asymmetric map with at least three players and one significant property outlier against a similar group.'}
